  "final_answer_text": "Here's what's available:\n\n**Vehicle presets with `plant: coupled6`** (the only ones eligible for your request):\n| id | name | validation status |\n|---|---|---|\n| `vehicle-b-rudder` | USV propeller/rudder monohull | **fails** precommitted trajectory/IMO tolerances — literature coefficients not validated for USV scale |\n| `vehicle-c-azimuth` | Dual-azimuth overactuated USV | control allocation demonstrated only; **dynamics not independently validated** |\n\n⚠️ Neither coupled6 preset is a validated dynamics model. I'm flagging this explicitly rather than quietly picking one for you — please choose knowingly, or tell me if you want to proceed anyway.\n\n**Sensor plugins** (optional, only if you want any): gps, imu, camera, lidar, fan-rangefinder, radar, single-beam-depth-sounder, survey-sonar-38khz, anemometer, barometer, hygrometer, water-quality, platform-telemetry, magnetometer, ins-gps-fusion.\n\n---\n\nTo build the scenario I still need you to specify:\n\n1. **Wave amplitude_m** — ?\n2. **Wave period_s** — ?\n3. **Wave direction_rad** — ?\n4. (optional) `phase_rad`, `water_depth_m`\n5. **Vehicle preset**: `vehicle-b-rudder` or `vehicle-c-azimuth`?\n6. **Experiment**: name, seed, timestep_s, duration_s\n7. **Backend**: type (`browser`/`node`/`tensor-cpu`/`tensor-mps`/`tensor-cuda`), and parallel_environments if relevant\n8. **Mission**: waypoint list (north_m/east_m pairs) or surveyor-waypoint (lat/lon origin+waypoints+ERP) — note surveyor-waypoint is tied to the SR-Surveyor preset which is planar3, so for coupled6 you'd likely want the plain `waypoint` mission type\n9. Any sensors you want attached\n10. Initial state / integrator choices (optional, have schema defaults only if you specify them — I won't assume)\n\nPlease provide values for at least items 1–8 so I can validate and construct the scenario without inventing anything on your behalf.",
